rences, 0 unintended.\n\n**Questions for a human.** Does every execDetached write start under a real burst? Do bin/ callers treat a superseded exit 1 as Escape? Peer death still strands a caller (KI stays open).\n\n**Not caused by this PR.** Readiness is blocked. The next decision asks to investigate catalog_version_pinned and spec_lint_input_domain_obligation_missing: both come from the newer engine and fail identically on the unchanged baseline with that engine. The obligation gates and the 2 missing_obligation blockers pre-date the change. Two compatibility findings need a reviewer: the #9057 test flip (intended) and a B8N9 witness that only moved lines. Effects were not analyzed (QML)."}
